      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>ACCOMPLISHMENTS for this fiscal Year, July 1, 2022 - June 30, 2023</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>PURPOSE: UPTOWN CSC'S PURPOSE IS TO SERVE AS A HUBORGANIZATION, CONNECTING NEIGHBORS IN NEED WITH THOSE DONATING THERI TIME, TALENTS AND FINANCES. OUR VISION IS TO ASSIST NEIGHBORS, WHO MAY NOT HAVE MEANS OR RESOURCES TO ACHIEVE THEIR DESIRED QUALITY OF LIFE, WHILE PROVIDING DIRECT SUPPORTIVE SERVICES SUCH AS A MAIL ADDRESS, DAILY FOOD, HYGIENE ITEMS, CLEAN CLOTHING, AND SHOWERS. OUR CLIENTS ALSO HAVE THE OPPORTUNITY TO OBTAIN HOUSING AND ACCESS TO JOB TRAINING.STATISTICAL SUMMARY OF SERVICES, JULY 1, 2024 TO DECEMBER 31, 2024: [WE HAD TO CHANGE LOCATIONS IN AUGUST, AND LOST SOME PEOPLE BUT ARE GAINING NEW ONES.] TOTAL VISITS FOR 6 MONTHS: 4,807. VISITS FOR MAIL - 2,807; FOOD - 535; SHOWERS - 399; HYGIENE - 209.MAJOR ACCOMPLISHMENTS IN THIS PERIOD OF TIME (JULY - DECEMBER): A COMPLETE NEW BOARD OF DIRECTORS, WITH FRESH IDEAS. WE WERE ASKED TO MOVE FROM OUR LOCATION (BECAUSE OF CHURCH PLANS CHANGING TO CONSTRUCT A NEW BUILDING). WE LOCATIED TO ONE LOCATION, ONLY UPON TIME THAT LOCATION CHANGED THEIR REQUIREMENTS. lUCKILY, WE FOUND ANOTHER NEW LOCATION, CLOSER TO WHERE WE HAD BEEN FOR OVER FIVE YEARS. WE ARE BUILDING A NEW CLIENTAL AND MODIFYING SOME OF THE THINGS WE WERE DOING.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
